{"name":"Renaissance Revival","title":"Renaissance Revival","revision":227689,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Renaissance_Revival","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Renaissance Revival refers to a trend originating from the 1990s that reinterprets elements from fashion and art of the Renaissance through a cotemporary lens."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visuals"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The aesthetic is defined by imagery reminiscent of the Renaissance era, drawing inspiration from fairytales, Greco-Roman paintings and art styles from the Middle Ages and Elizabethan period. Visuals often use warm muted colors, sepia filters/textures and renaissance script fonts to evoke a sense of antique quality."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Renaissance Revival is based on the silhouettes of the era. Common attire includes corsets, Elizabethan ruffle collars, bodices and long dresses."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Movies"},{"kind":"list","text":"Queen Margot (1994)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Romeo + Juliet (1996)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dangerous Beauty (1998)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Elizabeth (1998)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ever After (1998)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Shakespeare in Love (1998)"},{"kind":"list","text":"A Midsummer Night's Dream (1999)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Messenger: The Story of Joan of Arc (1999)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Get Over It (2001)"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/1/17/Original_171e339f64fb56f040330db176d5ae38.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20260215051615","caption":"Original 171e339f64fb56f040330db176d5ae38","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Original_171e339f64fb56f040330db176d5ae38.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0844-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/2/2b/Loreena_mckennitt.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260118045424","caption":"Renaissance Revival · Visual reference 02","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Loreena_mckennitt.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0844-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}